@@ -0,0 +1,30 @@
+---
+schema_version: 1
+id: openapi-client
+kind: fragment
+category: tooling
+name: Generated OpenAPI client (spike)
+description: Spike 3 link. Generates a typed React Query client from the API part's OpenAPI document with Orval, pointed at the client part's own fetch function, and checks the generated output is current.
+tags: [openapi, client, link]
+applies_to: [react-vite]
+deps:
+  dev: [orval]
+verify:
+  - name: openapi-client-config
+    layer: check
+    run: "test -s orval.config.ts && grep -q './openapi.json' orval.config.ts"
+---
+
+# Generated OpenAPI client
+
+The client part reads the API part's OpenAPI document from `./openapi.json` beside this config. The workspace's root command copies the API part's committed `openapi.json` there; this fragment never names another part's directory.
+
+## Setup
+
+1. Add Orval as a dev dependency of the client part.
+2. Run the workspace's root command that copies the API part's document, then `bun run openapi:generate` in the client part.
+3. Point the generated hooks' mutator at the client part's fetch function (`src/api/client.ts`) so generated and hand-written calls share one transport.
+
+## Changing the API
+
+A renamed operation in the API part renames its generated hook here. Regenerate, then fix the call sites the type checker reports.
